ss=\"kg-bookmark-metadata\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"kg-bookmark-icon\" src=\"https://engintezcan.com/content/images/size/w256h256/2022/07/engintezcan.png\"/><span class=\"kg-bookmark-author\">Engin Tezcan</span><span class=\"kg-bookmark-publisher\">Engin Tezcan</span></div></div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-thumbnail\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521741086919-156a4bda689d?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=MnwxMTc3M3wwfDF8c2VhcmNofDF8fHRhbmslMjB0b3l8ZW58MHx8fHwxNjc3OTM3OTYy&amp;ixlib=rb-4.0.3&amp;q=80&amp;w=2000content/images/size/w1200\"/></div></a></figure><p><br/>Strateji ilminin babası Clausewitz'in gözünden, Uber'in rakibi Lyft'in eski ve yeni CEO'su. (Pro-abonelere özel)</p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-bookmark-card\"><a class=\"kg-bookmark-container\" href=\"https://engintezcan.com/2-ceo-1-general/\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-content\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-title\">2 CEO 1 general📌</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-description\">Strateji ilminin babası Clausewitz’in gözünden, Uber’in rakibi Lyft’in eski ve yeni CEO’su.</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-metadata\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"kg-bookmark-icon\" src=\"https://engintezcan.com/content/images/size/w256h256/2022/07/engintezcan.png\"/><span class=\"kg-bookmark-author\">Engin Tezcan</span><span class=\"kg-bookmark-publisher\">Engin Tezcan</span></div></div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-thumbnail\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524669942788-b616ad1c4a13?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=MnwxMTc3M3wwfDF8c2VhcmNofDF8fGx5ZnR8ZW58MHx8fHwxNjgxMDM3MTEy&amp;ixlib=rb-4.0.3&amp;q=80&amp;w=2000content/images/size/w1200\"/></div></a></figure><p><br/>Bazı güçlü markalara baktığımızda, birbirini tekrar eden bir model görürüz. Bu örüntüyü anlamalıyız. (Pro-abonelere özel)</p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-bookmark-card\"><a class=\"kg-bookmark-container\" href=\"https://engintezcan.com/guclu-markalar-yaratmak-icin-firsatlar-ayrisma/\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-content\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-title\">Güçlü markalar yaratmak için fırsatlar: Ayrışma📌</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-description\">Bazı güçlü markalara baktığımızda, birbirini tekrar eden bir model görürüz. Bu örüntüyü anlamalıyız.</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-metadata\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"kg-bookmark-icon\" src=\"https://engintezcan.com/content/images/size/w256h256/2022/07/engintezcan.png\"/><span class=\"kg-bookmark-author\">Engin Tezcan</span><span class=\"kg-bookmark-publisher\">Engin Tezcan</span></div></div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-thumbnail\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1538935732373-f7a495fea3f6?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wxMTc3M3wwfDF8c2VhcmNofDMwfHxicmFuY2hlc3xlbnwwfHx8fDE2ODY4MjMyNzl8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.0.3&amp;q=80&amp;w=2000content/images/size/w1200\"/></div></a></figure><p>Doğru vaadi seçmek yeter mi? Vaat nasıl desteklenir? (Pro-abonelere özel)</p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-bookmark-card\"><a class=\"kg-bookmark-container\" href=\"https://engintezcan.com/bir-bardak-bakteri/\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-content\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-title\">Bir bardak bakteri📌</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-description\">Vaatler ve destekler</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-metadata\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"kg-bookmark-icon\" src=\"https://engintezcan.com/content/images/size/w256h256/2022/07/engintezcan.png\"/><span class=\"kg-bookmark-author\">Engin Tezcan</span><span class=\"kg-bookmark-publisher\">Engin Tezcan</span></div></div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-thumbnail\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1532094349884-543bc11b234d?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wxMTc3M3wwfDF8c2VhcmNofDJ8fHNjaWVuY2V8ZW58MHx8fHwxNjk2MDc2NDk0fDA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.0.3&amp;q=80&amp;w=2000content/images/size/w1200\"/></div></a></figure><p>İyi öyküleri tanımak ve 3 öykü şeması.</p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-bookmark-card\"><a class=\"kg-bookmark-container\" href=\"https://engintezcan.com/hikayeyi-koklamak/\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-content\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-title\">Hikayeyi koklamak📌</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-description\">İyi öyküleri tanımak ve 3 öykü şeması</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-metadata\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"kg-bookmark-icon\" src=\"https://engintezcan.com/content/images/size/w256h256/2022/07/engintezcan.png\"/><span class=\"kg-bookmark-author\">Engin Tezcan</span><span class=\"kg-bookmark-publisher\">Engin Tezcan</span></div></div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-thumbnail\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610478920409-ec0f58e881a5?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wxMTc3M3wwfDF8c2VhcmNofDh8fHNhbmR3aWNoJTIwc3Vid2F5fGVufDB8fHx8MTY5NDE2NzEzOXww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.0.3&amp;q=80&amp;w=2000content/images/size/w1200\"/></div></a></figure><p><br/></p><div class=\"kg-card kg-header-card kg-v2 kg-width-full kg-content-wide\" data-background-color=\"#3bc1c4\" style=\"background-color: #3bc1c4;\">\n<div class=\"kg-header-card-content\">\n<div class=\"kg-header-card-text kg-align-center\">\n<h2 class=\"kg-header-card-heading\" data-text-color=\"#FFFFFF\" id=\"serilertefrikalar\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Seriler/tefrikalar</span></h2>\n<p class=\"kg-header-card-subheading\" data-text-color=\"#FFFFFF\" id=\"2023-semeler\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">2023 Seçmeler</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><p>Güçlü markalar yaratmak için 12 temel ilke. 12 ilkenin tamamı:</p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-bookmark-card\"><a class=\"kg-bookmark-container\" href=\"https://engintezcan.com/tag/12ilke/\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-content\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-title\">12ilke - Engin Tezcan</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-description\">Güçlü markalar yaratmak için 12 temel ilke.\nHer hafta 1 ilke e-posta kutunuzda.</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-metadata\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"kg-bookmark-icon\" src=\"https://engintezcan.com/content/images/size/w256h256/2022/07/engintezcan.png\"/><span class=\"kg-bookmark-author\">Engin Tezcan</span><span class=\"kg-bookmark-publisher\">Engin Tezcan</span></div></div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-thumbnail\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://engintezcan.com/content/images/size/w1200/2023/05/12ilke-ghostpost-1.png\"/></div></a></figure><p>Apple, Google, Amazon gibi devlerden değil. Yeni ve büyüyen markalardan ilham veren haberler.</p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-bookmark-card\"><a class=\"kg-bookmark-container\" href=\"https://engintezcan.com/tag/limitedpost/\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-content\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-title\">LimitedPost - Engin Tezcan</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-description\">Büyüyen markalardan ilham veren haberler</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-metadata\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"kg-bookmark-icon\" src=\"https://engintezcan.com/content/images/size/w256h256/2022/07/engintezcan.png\"/><span class=\"kg-bookmark-author\">Engin Tezcan</span><span class=\"kg-bookmark-publisher\">Engin Tezcan</span></div></div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-thumbnail\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://engintezcan.com/content/images/size/w1200/2023/04/limitedpost_post01-1.jpg\"/></div></a></figure><p><br/>Markanızı yönetirken doğru adımlar atmanız için, 24 temel kavramın kılçıksız açıklaması. </p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-bookmark-card\"><a class=\"kg-bookmark-container\" href=\"https://engintezcan.com/tag/kilciksiz-markalama/\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-content\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-title\">Kılçıksız Markalama - Engin Tezcan</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-description\">Markanızı yönetirken doğru adımlar atmanız için, 24 temel kavramın kılçıksız açıklaması</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-metadata\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"kg-bookmark-icon\" src=\"https://engintezcan.com/content/images/size/w256h256/2022/07/engintezcan.png\"/><span class=\"kg-bookmark-author\">Engin Tezcan</span><span class=\"kg-bookmark-publisher\">Engin Tezcan</span></div></div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-thumbnail\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://engintezcan.com/content/images/size/w1200/2023/08/K-l--ks-z-PostHeader.jpg\"/></div></a></figure><p>Doğruyu bulmak için yanlışlardan kaçınmak yeter. Markanızın sağlığı için bu elmaları yemeyin. Markalara yasak elmalar. Pro-aboneler için özel seri.</p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-bookmark-card\"><a class=\"kg-bookmark-container\" href=\"https://engintezcan.com/tag/yasak-elmalar/\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-content\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-title\">Yasak Elmalar - Engin Tezcan</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-description\">Doğruyu bulmak için yanlışlardan kaçınmak yeter. Markanızın sağlığı için bu elmaları yemeyin.</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-metadata\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"kg-bookmark-icon\" src=\"https://engintezcan.com/content/images/size/w256h256/2022/07/engintezcan.png\"/><span class=\"kg-bookmark-author\">Engin Tezcan</span><span class=\"kg-bookmark-publisher\">Engin Tezcan</span></div></div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-thumbnail\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://engintezcan.com/content/images/size/w1200/2023/08/YasakElma-PostHeader-2.jpg\"/></div></a></figure><div class=\"kg-card kg-header-card kg-v2 kg-width-full kg-content-wide\" data-background-color=\"#7d3bc4\" style=\"background-color: #7d3bc4;\">\n<div class=\"kg-header-card-content\">\n<div class=\"kg-header-card-text kg-align-center\">\n<h2 class=\"kg-header-card-heading\" data-text-color=\"#FFFFFF\" id=\"nceki-yl\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Önceki yıl</span></h2>\n<p class=\"kg-header-card-subheading\" data-text-color=\"#FFFFFF\" id=\"2022\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">2022</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><p>2022'nin en çok okunanları👇</p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-bookmark-card\"><a class=\"kg-bookmark-container\" href=\"https://engintezcan.com/2022nin-en-cok-okunanlari/\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-content\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-title\">Yılın en çok okunanları</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-desc